OL,3,ASummer 2026 expected to be declared
OL,4,AUK's hottest on record
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe temperature figures are in line
OL,7,Fwith evidence that summers are getting
OL,8,Fhotter, with more intense and frequent
OL,9,Fheatwaves, as a result of human-induced
OL,10,Fclimate change. Records are being
OL,11,Fbroken more often - and by bigger
OL,12,Fmargins.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
